/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Service Resource C++ Library
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Service Resource C++ Library** is a Keyple add-on that provides
 * a profile-based card resource allocation mechanism for managing smart card
 * resources in multi-reader environments.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Profile-based card resource allocation
 * - Automatic reader and card selection
 * - Resource pooling and management
 * - Multi-reader environment support
 * - Dynamic resource allocation strategies
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
 * - **API Documentation**: [docs.keyple.org/keyple-service-resource-cpp-lib](https://docs.keyple.org/keyple-service-resource-cpp-lib)
 * - **Examples**: [github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example](https://github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example)
 */
